{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2014\u2014 A deserted shopping street at midnight. You must deliver sushi.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every night, something is off. The same path as yesterday now hides <strong><i>&quot;anomalies.&quot;</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver the sushi carefully. No matter what happens\u2014<strong><i>_do not_</i></strong> drop it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909290/extras/27c173e95c382ffa560f14b937ebdd15.avif?t=1756353389\" data-has-big width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A short horror game about delivering sushi.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly changing anomalies each night    </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes jump scares    </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime: Around 30 minutes (longer to find all events)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909290/extras/3606c652bb8e7482887fa2299a439c38.avif?t=1756353389\" data-has-big width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Tips</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click and hold the left mouse button to grab the sushi.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dropping it on the ground results in a game over.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the sushi touches an &quot;anomaly&quot; (paranormal event), it will fall.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Streaming Policy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No restrictions. Monetized streams are allowed.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3909290?t=1756353389","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3909290?t=1