ay Tips</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click and hold the left mouse button to grab the sushi.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dropping it on the ground results in a game over.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the sushi touches an &quot;anomaly&quot; (paranormal event), it will fall.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Streaming Policy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No restrictions. Monetized streams are allowed.</p>","developers":["Neruneko"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909290/a0799dc7453362da48c598ce2a6308fa1eb7f1ce/header.jpg?t=1756353389","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257176535,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257176535/movie480.mp4?t=1754019743","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257176535/movie_max.mp4?t=1754019743"},"name":"PV1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257176535/0846d55bccfd7be7fae7b19bcca1c7b57e315fc1/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1754019743","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257176535/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1754019743","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257176535/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1754019743"}}],"name":"SUSHI DELIVERY","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong